<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil electricity stocks started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil electricity stocks started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear, Stearns &amp; Co said on Friday it had started coverage of five Brazilian electric power companies.</p>
<p>-- Analysts Melissa Ruttner and Marco Soligo rated as buys Companhia Energetica de Sao Paulo, or CESP ; Companhia Paulista de Forca e Luz, or CPFL ; and state holding Eletrobras.</p>
<p>-- Light Servicos de Eletricidade and Companhia de Eletricidade do Estado do Rio de Janeiro, or CERJ, were rated attractive.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
